        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It is agreed that every effort will be made to provide chairpersons with release time to carry out their duties. Chairpersons who are not afforded release time shall be compensated for their duties at the rate of $1,000 for the school year and will be considered a part of the salary re-opener for the duration of this contract. If the compensation rate is not changed during any re-opener, it shall remain at $1,000 for the duration of the Agreement.",
